{"meta":{"id":"holiday-calendar","category":"it/tools/api","title":"한국 · 미국 공휴일 달력","subtitle":"","summary":"react-calendar + date-holidays 로 한국/미국 공휴일 표시","tags":["달력","공휴일","date-holidays","react-calendar","dayjs"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"testserver","updatedAt":""},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>TOOL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">한국 · 미국 공휴일 달력</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> react-calendar + date-holidays 로 한국/미국 공휴일 표시</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기능</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">react-calendar 로 달력을 그리고, date-holidays 로 한국(KR) · 미국(US) 공휴일을 같은 해 기준으로 불러와 날짜에 표시합니다. 선택한 날짜 기준 180일 전/후 날짜 계산도 함께 보여 줍니다. (dayjs)</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">공휴일 불러오기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const fetchKoreanHolidays = () =&gt; {\r\nconst hd = new Holidays(&#x27;KR&#x27;); // ← 한국 코드\r\nconst list = hd.getHolidays(year);\r\nconst formatted = list.map(h =&gt; ({\r\n    date: dayjs(h.date).format(&#x27;YYYY-MM-DD&#x27;),\r\n    name: h.name,\r\n}));\r\n    setKoreanHolidays(formatted);\r\n};\r\n\r\nconst fetchUsHolidays = () =&gt; {\r\n    const hd = new Holidays(&#x27;US&#x27;);\r\n    const list = hd.getHolidays(year);\r\n    const formatted = list.map(h =&gt; ({\r\n        date: dayjs(h.date).format(&#x27;YYYY-MM-DD&#x27;),\r\n        name: h.name,\r\n    }));\r\n    setUsHolidays(formatted);\r\n};\r\n\r\nfetchKoreanHolidays();\r\nfetchUsHolidays();</pre></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/tools/api/holiday-calendar","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"tools","title":"기타 작업물","path":"it/tools"},{"id":"api","title":"API · 라이브러리 활용","path":"it/tools/api"}],"hasImage":false}